'''Manic Mohawk Cat''' (大狂乱のネコモヒカン ''Dai Kyōran no Neko Mohikan'', '''Manic Mohawk Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Deathhawk (Deadly)|Deathhawk]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Manic Mohawk Cat
|image = E 242.png
|appearance = [[Deathhawk (Deadly)]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 31|Infernal Tower - Floor 31]]
|money drop = 1,980¢ - 7,821¢
}}

==Enemy==
Meet your worst nightmare. This feral feline has extreme health and attack power, as well as faster movement speed than [[Crazed Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Cat]]. Even the short range plays in his favor, as he can burst past your frontline more easily when combined with his increased speed.

He may seem impossible to stall, but if your [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] is level 30 and your [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] is at least level 20+23, then he won't push too much. Combine that with [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] and add support from cats like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and the battle won't be as hellish.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Deathhawk (Deadly)]] or [[Infernal Tower/Floor 31|Floor 31]].''

